Bugaboo loses her umbrella 😂☔ (and a dog finds it)

• il pleut = it's raining
• un parapluie = an umbrella
• un chien = a dog
• mignon = cute
• courons = let's run

🐶🐱 Dog or cat? Comment "chien" or "chat" 👇
